WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Find your opening. Bring the evidence.. Working v0.7 app captures. This is a screenshot walkthrough, not continuous footage.

2
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Opportunity Pulse. Discovery does not approve qualifications. Changed or unavailable sources require review.

3
00:00:50.000 --> 00:01:20.000
Evidence Passport. A proposed work sample is not completed work, an official credential or eligibility proof.

4
00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:45.000
A historical story, with boundaries. Institutional deliverables, first-person accounts and unknown career outcomes stay distinct.

5
00:01:45.000 --> 00:02:15.000
Prepare the human conversation. Ready for human discussion means eligibility remains unknown. No application is sent.

6
00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:30.000
Test the public benefit honestly. Software works today. Career benefit, equitable access and faster advising remain hypotheses.
